DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/artifacts/namespaces/{namespace}
Deletes an empty Artifacts namespace.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID.; namespace (path) — Artifacts namespace name.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/artifacts/namespaces/{namespace}
Returns an Artifacts namespace summary.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID.; namespace (path) — Artifacts namespace name.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/artifacts/namespaces/{namespace}/repos/{name}/blob/{hash}
Returns raw bytes for an immutable Git blob object. Blob responses are cacheable forever by hash.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID.; namespace (path) — Artifacts namespace name.; name (path) — Repository name.; hash (path) — 40-character lowercase hexadecimal Git object hash.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/artifacts/namespaces/{namespace}/repos/{name}/commit/{hash}
Returns decoded metadata for an immutable Git commit object. Commit responses are cacheable forever by hash.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID.; namespace (path) — Artifacts namespace name.; name (path) — Repository name.; hash (path) — 40-character lowercase hexadecimal Git object hash.

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/artifacts/namespaces/{namespace}/repos/{name}
Deletes a repository and schedules cleanup of its backing data.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID.; namespace (path) — Artifacts namespace name.; name (path) — Repository name.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/artifacts/namespaces/{namespace}/repos/{name}
Returns repository metadata.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID.; namespace (path) — Artifacts namespace name.; name (path) — Repository name.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/artifacts/namespaces/{namespace}/repos/{name}/raw/{ref}/{path}
Returns file bytes resolved by ref and path, with a sniffed content type and browser-safe response headers.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID.; namespace (path) — Artifacts namespace name.; name (path) — Repository name.; ref (path) — Git ref, branch, tag, or 40-character commit hash.; path (path) — File path. May contain slashes.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/artifacts/namespaces/{namespace}/repos/{name}/tree/{hash}
Returns decoded entries for an immutable Git tree object. Tree responses are cacheable forever by hash.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID.; namespace (path) — Artifacts namespace name.; name (path) — Repository name.; hash (path) — 40-character lowercase hexadecimal Git object hash.

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/artifacts/namespaces/{namespace}/tokens/{id}
Revokes an Artifacts repository token.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID.; namespace (path) — Artifacts namespace name.; id (path) — Token ID. Must match /^[0-9a-z]{16}$/.
